Add experimental scheduling goodput metrics, `gpu.scheduling.badput_time` and `gpu.scheduling.fully_admitted_time`, behind the `collect_scheduling_goodput` option. Badput continues after admission until the pods are ready, and carries a `reason` tag with one of six general categories (`quota_or_capacity`, `placement_or_topology`, `configuration_or_request`, `preemption_or_reclaim`, `startup_or_system`, `other_or_unknown`), the raw `scheduler_reason`, and a `gpu_type` tag when known.
